  "contentHtml": "<p>바이브 코딩을 이용해서 교과서 가상실험을 만들고 있다.&#160;</p><p>2022 천재교과서(임) 교과서에 나오는 내용과 일치하게 만들어서 사용할 예정이다.</p><p><b>(물론 다른 교과서도 2022 개정교육과정에서는&#160; 실험이 비슷하기 때문에 해당 학습내용에서 사용해도 된다. )</b></p><p>아래는 3단원 교과서 pdf 파일이다. 저화질로 압축해 놓은 파일이다. 원본 파일은 천재교과서 사이트에 가서 다운 받을 수 있다.</p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/17394bc0a8401630ecef8e057fd8c32faefc537f?download\" data-file-name=\"3단원_열과우리생활.pdf\" data-file-size=\"3510401\" data-mimetype=\"application/pdf\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHp%26dataid%3D1478%26fileid%3D1%26regdt%3D20260414204838&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2F17394bc0a8401630ecef8e057fd8c32faefc537f')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">3단원_열과우리생활</span><span class=\"type\">.pdf</span></div><div class=\"size\">3.35MB</div></div></a></div><p style=\"text-align: start;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\"><span style=\"color: #ee2323;\"><b>교과서 페이지를 펴 놓고 아래 가상실험을 이용해서 교과서 탐구나 해보기에 답을 달게 할 수 있다.</b></span></p><p style=\"text-align: start;\"><span style=\"color: #ee2323;\"><b>가상실험을 미리 해보고, 실제 실험을 하면 실험을 하는데도 도움이 많이 된다.&#160;</b></span></p><p style=\"text-align: start;\"><span style=\"color: #ee2323;\"><b>또 과제로 내서 집에가서 도전해 보게 할 수도 있다.&#160;</b></span></p><p style=\"text-align: start;\"><span style=\"color: #ee2323;\"><b>실제 수업시간에 잘 활용하면 교사입장에서 설명하기 편하고, 때로는 학생들이 모둠별이나 각자 직접 해 보게 할 수 도 있다.<br>만약 모든 학생들이 해 볼 수 없는 경우에는 대표학생 한명을 앞으로 나오게 해서 조작을 하면서 설명해 보게 할 수 있다.<br><br>그것만으로도 다른 학생들 관심을 끌고, 자신이 대표학생으로 걸릴지도 모르기 때문에 공부하게 하는 효과가 있다.<br><br>제일 좋은 방법은 2명당 태블릿pc 1개를 주고 서로 설명하게 하는 방법이다.</b></span></p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size18\"><b>1.&#160;교과서&#160;76페이지&#160;(해보기)&#160;고무줄의&#160;온도&#160;변화&#160;알아보기</b></span> <br><a href=\"https://sciencej1.cafe24.com/html5/sci1/gomu.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://sciencej1.cafe24.com/html5/sci1/gomu.html</a><br><br></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1a9b4004816949c406879ca011d0f0571f8337a7\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1a9b4004816949c406879ca011d0f0571f8337a7\" data-origin-width=\"815\" data-origin-height=\"456\"></div><p style=\"text-align: start;\">고무줄을 당길때 마다 열에너지가 발생해서 온도가 올라간다. <br><br>일반카메라로&#160;보면&#160;아무&#160;변화가&#160;없지만,&#160;열화상&#160;카메라로&#160;보면&#160;온도가&#160;변하는&#160;것을&#160;볼&#160;수&#160;있다. <br><br>또&#160;더이상&#160;당기지&#160;않으면&#160;점점&#160;식는&#160;것도&#160;볼&#160;수&#160;있다. <br><br><br><br><b><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">2.&#160;교과서&#160;77페이지&#160;-&#160;물의&#160;입자운동과&#160;온도&#160;변화</span></b> <br><a href=\"https://sciencej1.cafe24.com/html5/sci1/wateron.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://sciencej1.cafe24.com/html5/sci1/wateron.html</a><br><br></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/502503e943346768b03ad30ed06c60bc99687294\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/502503e943346768b03ad30ed06c60bc99687294\" data-origin-width=\"832\" data-origin-height=\"462\"></div><p style=\"text-align: start;\"><br>왼쪽과&#160;오른쪽&#160;물의&#160;온도를&#160;변화시켜&#160;가며&#160;물&#160;안에서&#160;입자가&#160;어떻게&#160;움직이는지&#160;비교해&#160;볼&#160;수&#160;있다. <br><br><b></b></p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\"><b><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">3.&#160;교과서&#160;78페이지&#160;-&#160;열평형&#160;탐구(뜨거운&#160;물과&#160;찬물의&#160;온도&#160;변화&#160;측정하기)</span></b> <br><a href=\"https://sciencej1.cafe24.com/html5/sci1/thermale.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://sciencej1.cafe24.com/html5/sci1/thermale.html</a><br><br></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c18fdf85745c211697914e2fbcbff879985cb271\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c18fdf85745c211697914e2fbcbff879985cb271\" data-origin-width=\"979\" data-origin-height=\"546\"></div><p style=\"text-align: start;\"><br>A&#160;물체와&#160;B&#160;물체의&#160;온도와&#160;양을&#160;결정하고&#160;실험시작을&#160;누르면&#160;두&#160;물체가&#160;서로&#160;접촉하고&#160;시간에&#160;따라&#160;열평형을&#160;이룬다. <br><br>이때&#160;각&#160;물체&#160;안에&#160;입자&#160;운동이&#160;어떻게&#160;변하는지도&#160;비교해&#160;볼&#160;수&#160;있다. <br><br><br><br><b><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">4.&#160;교과서&#160;80페이지&#160;-&#160;열의&#160;전도&#160;비교하기&#160;</span></b> <br><a href=\"https://sciencej1.cafe24.com/html5/sci1/transmission.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://sciencej1.cafe24.com/html5/sci1/transmission.html</a><br><br></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/db403608c63bf7c8e564f90876d97c7154aa7b48\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/db403608c63bf7c8e564f90876d97c7154aa7b48\" data-origin-width=\"1034\" data-origin-height=\"573\"></div><p style=\"text-align: start;\"><br><br>철판,&#160;유리판,&#160;구리판을&#160;뜨거운&#160;물에&#160;담그고&#160;열의&#160;이동을&#160;관찰한다. <br><br>3개의&#160;금속을&#160;뜨거운&#160;물에&#160;담그고,&#160;열화상&#160;카메라를&#160;켜고&#160;관찰하면&#160;열이&#160;이동해&#160;가는&#160;것을&#160;볼&#160;수&#160;있다. <br><br>뜨거운&#160;물에서&#160;꺼내면&#160;식는&#160;것을&#160;볼&#160;수&#160;있다. <br><br>(단&#160;식을&#160;때는&#160;그대로&#160;식는&#160;것이&#160;아니라,&#160;전도에&#160;의해서&#160;금속판&#160;전체가&#160;열평형을&#160;이루면서&#160;식는&#160;것을&#160;확인할&#160;수&#160;있다.&#160;뜨거운&#160;물에서&#160;꺼내도&#160;아래쪽&#160;뜨거운&#160;열은&#160;금속판&#160;전체로&#160;골고루&#160;퍼지게&#160;된다.) <br><br><b></b></p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size18\"><b>5.&#160;교과서&#160;81페이지&#160;-&#160;열의&#160;대류&#160;확인하기&#160;</b></span> <br><a href=\"https://sciencej1.cafe24.com/html5/sci1/convection.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://sciencej1.cafe24.com/html5/sci1/convection.html</a><br><br></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/68109b3e30b41c900ea5b97a9d7546f174ac2903\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/68109b3e30b41c900ea5b97a9d7546f174ac2903\" data-origin-width=\"1268\" data-origin-height=\"710\"></div><p style=\"text-align: start;\"><br>초&#160;위치를&#160;잡고&#160;초&#160;불을&#160;켜면&#160;대류가&#160;일어나고,&#160;열화상&#160;모드에서&#160;열의&#160;이동을&#160;관찰할&#160;수&#160;있다. <br><br><b></b></p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\"><b><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">6.&#160;교과서&#160;81페이지&#160;-&#160;열의&#160;복사&#160;확인하기&#160;</span></b> <br><a href=\"https://sciencej1.cafe24.com/html5/sci1/radiation.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://sciencej1.cafe24.com/html5/sci1/radiation.html</a><br><br></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/2f9836fec2de31bc343dfca0aaecb12054ef3db1\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/2f9836fec2de31bc343dfca0aaecb12054ef3db1\" data-origin-width=\"1277\" data-origin-height=\"712\"></div><p style=\"text-align: start;\"><br>가림판을&#160;세우거나&#160;치우면서&#160;&#160;열화상&#160;모드에서&#160;열의&#160;이동을&#160;관찰할&#160;수&#160;있다. <br><br><b></b></p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size18\"><b>7.&#160;교과서&#160;82페이지&#160;-&#160;전도&#160;입자&#160;모형으로&#160;확인하기&#160;</b></span> <br><a href=\"https://sciencej1.cafe24.com/html5/sci1/convection1.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://sciencej1.cafe24.com/html5/sci1/convection1.html</a><br><br></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ccc22be3efbb01db40b3ce42c7d2c033281b1c52\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ccc22be3efbb01db40b3ce42c7d2c033281b1c52\" data-origin-width=\"1271\" data-origin-height=\"701\"></div><p style=\"text-align: start;\"><br>알콜&#160;램프를&#160;이동시킬&#160;수&#160;있다.&#160;전도가&#160;일어나는&#160;원인을&#160;입자모형으로&#160;확인할&#160;수&#160;있다.&#160; <br><br><b></b></p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size18\"><b>8.&#160;교과서&#160;82페이지&#160;-&#160;대류&#160;입자&#160;모형으로&#160;확인하기&#160;</b></span> <br><a href=\"https://sciencej.cafe24.com/html5/convection/ccurrent.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://sciencej.cafe24.com/html5/convection/ccurrent.html</a><br><br></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f1b3351cc919316d272f74579e3173e5f2835c5c\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f1b3351cc919316d272f74579e3173e5f2835c5c\" data-origin-width=\"1126\" data-origin-height=\"835\"></div><p style=\"text-align: start;\">대류 현상을 입자 모형으로 확인해 보자.&#160; <br><br>자세한&#160;설명&#160;링크&#160;참고 <br><br><a href=\"https://sciencelove.com/2726\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://sciencelove.com/2726</a></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"액체의 대류 가상실험 (웹용) - 열의 이동\" data-og-description=\"열전달 방법 중 액체의 대류에 대한 가상실험을 웹용으로 다시 만들었다. 아래 링크에서 실행시키면 된다. https://sciencej.cafe24.com/html5/convection/ccurrent.html 분자는 250개 사용 되었다. 불켜기를 하면\" data-og-host=\"sciencelove.com\" data-og-source-url=\"https://sciencelove.com/2726\" data-og-url=\"https://sciencelove.com/2726\" data-og-image=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/sxssf/dJMb81fT1Gp/CJG6onr7DDO53twrUf5SIk/img.png?width=800&amp;height=593&amp;face=0_0_800_593,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/bUMPhN/dJMb9bv3HhP/OFEKKHfMBemJbfHM3ciQJ0/img.png?width=800&amp;height=593&amp;face=0_0_800_593,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/vuIbA/dJMb9lk8xFE/uvVq42qE2cKheUsapBKIDK/img.png?width=1126&amp;height=835&amp;face=0_0_1126_835\"><a href=\"https://sciencelove.com/2726\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://sciencelove.com/2726\"><div class=\"og-image\"><img class=\"thumb_img\" src=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/sxssf/dJMb81fT1Gp/CJG6onr7DDO53twrUf5SIk/img.png?width=800&amp;height=593&amp;face=0_0_800_593,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/bUMPhN/dJMb9bv3HhP/OFEKKHfMBemJbfHM3ciQJ0/img.png?width=800&amp;height=593&amp;face=0_0_800_593,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/vuIbA/dJMb9lk8xFE/uvVq42qE2cKheUsapBKIDK/img.png?width=1126&amp;height=835&amp;face=0_0_1126_835\" alt=\"\" xxxxonerror=\"this.src=&quot;//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png&quot;\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">액체의 대류 가상실험 (웹용) - 열의 이동</p><p class=\"og-desc\">열전달 방법 중 액체의 대류에 대한 가상실험을 웹용으로 다시 만들었다. 아래 링크에서 실행시키면 된다. https://sciencej.cafe24.com/html5/convection/ccurrent.html 분자는 250개 사용 되었다. 불켜기를 하면</p><p class=\"og-host\">sciencelove.com</p></div></a></div><p style=\"text-align: start;\"><br><br><b><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">9.&#160;교과서&#160;88페이지&#160;-&#160;여러가지&#160;액체&#160;온도&#160;변화&#160;비교(비열)&#160;</span></b> <br><a href=\"https://sciencej1.cafe24.com/html5/sci1/specificheat.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://sciencej1.cafe24.com/html5/sci1/specificheat.html</a><br><br></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" 